<title>USA: UAL inaugurates Denver shuttle to Las Vegas.</title>
<headline>UAL inaugurates Denver shuttle to Las Vegas.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UAL Corp's United Airlines on Tuesday inaugurated its Denver to Las Vegas and Denver to Phoenix shuttle service.</p>
<p>The airline will have 12 daily round-trip flights to Las Vegas and 13 to Phoenix.</p>
</text>
